      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.boh_shenoute.leipoldt_ed:1-26",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲩⲱ ⲁϥⲡⲓⲥⲉ ⲙⲡ**ⲕⲟⲩⲓ** ⲛⲧⲃⲧ",
      "english": "And he cooked the small fish.",
      "source": "Apophthegmata Patrum Sahidic 115: Pistus 1",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ap.115.monbeg",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲛⲉⲟⲩⲟⲛ ϩⲁⲛⲕⲉ**ⲕⲟⲩϫⲓ** ⲛⲧⲉⲃⲧ ⲛⲧⲟⲧⲟⲩ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁϥⲥⲙⲟⲩ ⲉⲣⲱⲟⲩ ⲁϥϫⲟⲥ ⲉⲑⲣⲟⲩⲭⲱ ⲛⲛⲁⲓⲕⲉⲭⲱⲟⲩⲛⲓ ⲛⲁϩⲣⲁⲩ .",
      "english": "They had a few small fish. Having blessed them, he said to serve these also.",
